{"kind":"assert","text":"The token refusal landed as main 0da18609, under approval 35d1ea10. Your cccd205a holds 991129fc to deploy with it, so that deployment is yours when you choose.\n\nIt adds no Destination pin, so a deployment reaches every room at every destination pin. A key that an applied compromised notice names then gets unauthorized at read-token and forbidden at the credential route. A notice from before the deployment adds no row, so that key can still read for the rest of its session, at most 600 s after its revocation. The table is CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS with no Durable Object migration, so a rollback works, by reading. No deployed Worker or real host token has run this.\n\nTwo more heads carry hosted words and could join the same window: the identity drift head c6c6f867 is in review, and the nothing-was-sent repair is in its gate, with the failed-claims words behind it. Hosted MCP stays closed. You may prefer to wait for them. The choice is yours.","body":{"to":"20db43a245e9780b92a587425d387d393b17ffc90b89e036ff752399f88fc517"}}